WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:03.810 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
At their evening home gathering, I
announced:

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:08.250 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I have decided to be baptized this
coming Sunday and become a Christian.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:16.490 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
But the thought that my whole life would
end up in religion made me deeply sad.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:22.110 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I could not help venting my frustration
on these Christians.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:26.050 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Wait, I said. Although I have decided to
be baptized,

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:30.790 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I still have three deep regrets that I
want to tell you about.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:35.150 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
First, I was raised with a scientific
education.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:40.036 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
What I most admired was the motto carved
on my university's administration

00:00:40.036 --> 00:00:40.630 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
building:

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:45.270 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
You must seek truth, and the truth will
set you free.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:50.510 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
You shall know the truth, and the truth
shall make you free.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:58.210 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Yet the Bible you ask me to believe
describes Jesus walking on the sea,

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:02.190 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
and Jesus rising from the dead. This is
absurd!

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:07.950 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Asking me to believe this Bible is
asking me to abandon my pursuit of
truth.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:13.550 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Second, all my life I have loved freedom
and respected others.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:17.910 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
So I hate having moral burdens imposed
on me.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:24.790 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Although I am not a Christian, I know
that once I become one,

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:30.650 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
people will burden me with different
moral standards. They will say:

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:36.030 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Aren't you a Christian? Why do you get
angry?

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.230 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Aren't you a Christian? Why stop your
car on a yellow line?

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:48.290 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I have always loved freedom. I really
dislike having moral burdens forced on
me.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:52.710 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The thought of it made me deeply sad.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:58.490 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Third, people in science have a lofty
lifelong goal:

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:05.170 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
to seek the greatest happiness for
people today and reduce their tears.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:09.090 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
So our hearts are not empty.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:12.743 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
We are full of love and care for our
fellow human beings, in the horizontal

00:02:12.743 --> 00:02:13.230 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
dimension.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:20.818 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
By contrast, Christians seem concerned
only with their relationship with God
and

00:02:20.818 --> 00:02:22.810 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
how much they love Him.

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:27.770 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Your love is vertical, but the love of
people in science is horizontal.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.010 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Now you want me to turn my horizontal
love into vertical love.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:35.950 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The thought brings me nothing but
sadness.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:39.150 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I poured out all three regrets in one
breath.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:47.196 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Many Christians there had believed for
twenty or thirty years. Suddenly, they

00:02:47.196 --> 00:02:48.450 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
fell silent.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.670 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
They looked at one another, unsure how
to answer.

00:02:53.510 --> 00:03:02.696 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
After a while, Uncle Geng, a humble
scholar I greatly respected, spoke on
their

00:03:02.696 --> 00:03:03.510 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
behalf.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:08.688 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He said, Asking you to believe in the
Lord does not mean giving up your care
for

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:09.270 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
humanity.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.490 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Second, we are accountable to the Lord.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:19.114 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
We need not be overly concerned with
others' moral judgments or the burdens
they

00:03:19.114 --> 00:03:20.190 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
impose on us.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:23.130 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
What matters is that you are right with
the Lord.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:30.830 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I could accept that answer, but in my
heart I still felt regret and sadness.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:36.891 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
A few days later, still carrying those
three regrets, Liao Shutao kept his

00:03:36.891 --> 00:03:38.260 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
promise and was baptized.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:43.240 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Yet after his baptism, he was not happy
in private.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:52.586 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
His wife knew how unhappy he was. Under
even greater pressure herself, she

00:03:52.586 --> 00:03:55.440 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
prayed earnestly for him.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:01.830 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
One evening, his wife and child went to
bed as usual.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:08.030 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Unable to sleep, Liao picked up some
gospel testimonies,

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.270 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
for a little diversion.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.910 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
These were spiritual books he found
easier to read.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:20.813 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
They told how different people had
become Christians, and many were
compelling

00:04:20.813 --> 00:04:21.970 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
life stories.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:31.320 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He came across a testimony called A
Shell Collector on the Shore of Truth.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:39.560 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The author was an American named Dudley
Evans. He began:

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:45.500 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
In the fall of 1970, when I first
arrived at the University of Texas,

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:50.000 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I considered myself a hard-core atheist.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.870 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Liao suddenly felt a joyful sense of
kinship.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.730 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
This man attended the same university as
I did, he thought.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.370 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The account continued:

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.190 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I entered this university to discover
the true meaning of life.

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:13.730 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
You shall know the truth, and the truth
shall make you free.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:22.139 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Standing before the university building
where this Bible verse was carved, he

00:05:22.139 --> 00:05:25.400 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
recalled repeating those
words—ironically,

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:29.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
vowing that he would find the truth
before leaving the university.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:35.160 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Reading this, Liao leapt to his feet.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:39.507 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He could hardly believe that this
American had attended the very same

00:05:39.507 --> 00:05:40.200 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
university,

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:47.599 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
walked past the same building, and felt
the same reverence for the words

00:05:47.599 --> 00:05:49.140 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
engraved there.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.360 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
With his heart pounding, he read on.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:55.320 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The author had searched everywhere for
the meaning and reality of life,

00:05:55.320 --> 00:06:01.040 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
even exploring Eastern philosophy and
religious practices.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.780 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Yet these left him feeling even emptier.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:09.500 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
In the depths of his emptiness and pain,

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:17.204 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Jesus refreshed his heart with a
wonderful, divine anointing, moving him
to

00:06:17.204 --> 00:06:17.820 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
tears.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:25.240 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
His personal experience of coming to
believe in the Lord deeply moved me.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:30.620 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
More importantly, he concluded with
these words:

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:35.300 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
From that day in February 1973 until
now,

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:41.704 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Christ has become more real within me
each day, and my experience of Him has

00:06:41.704 --> 00:06:42.800 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
grown richer.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:46.660 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
To everyone who is still seeking truth,

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:51.878 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I recommend the words of the Lord Jesus
engraved on our university's

00:06:51.878 --> 00:06:53.720 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
administration building:

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.420 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
You must seek truth, and the truth will
set you free.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.180 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
John 8:32.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:06.780 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He went on: This same Jesus also said,

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.420 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I am the truth.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:12.120 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
John 14:6.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:15.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Read those two statements together:

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:20.220 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
You must seek truth, and the truth will
set you free.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.580 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I am the truth.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:30.060 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
When I read that passage, I was
profoundly shaken.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:38.460 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
It felt like a dream. My whole life
until then seemed like a dream.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:44.331 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Years of scientific education had taught
me to appreciate what I considered the

00:07:44.331 --> 00:07:46.040 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
greatest saying of all,

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.500 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
and now I was discovering that Jesus was
the one who had said it!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:56.940 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
My past life seemed like a dream. Only
on that day did I truly wake up.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:08:01.012 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I found myself back at a starting point
I did not recognize, completely at a

00:08:01.012 --> 00:08:01.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
loss.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:07.640 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I put down the testimonies and searched
the Chinese Bible.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.540 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
It was true! The Lord Jesus had said
those words in the Gospel of John.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:17.698 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Still unconvinced, I opened the English
Bible. There were the very words

00:08:17.698 --> 00:08:19.560 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
engraved at my university.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:26.960 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
At that moment I became so overwhelmed
that I knelt down.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:31.380 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Jesus, I said, I bow before You in
complete admiration!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:37.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
At that moment, everything seemed
suddenly to become clear.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:43.820 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
It was as though Jesus quietly and
silently answered Liao's three
questions.

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:51.205 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
First, the saying he had admired most,
and thought faith would force him to

00:08:51.205 --> 00:08:55.340 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
abandon, had been spoken by Jesus
Himself.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:09:04.973 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Second, the moral burdens he hated and
his fear of losing freedom as a
Christian

00:09:04.973 --> 00:09:07.140 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
suddenly vanished.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:17.191 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Jesus Himself was telling him: Seek the
truth—in other words, seek Me—and I will

00:09:17.191 --> 00:09:18.600 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
set you free.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:25.131 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
If the true God and Savior of the
universe Himself promised to set him
free,

00:09:25.131 --> 00:09:27.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
what did he have to fear?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.800 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Third.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:38.840 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The great compassion for humanity he had
prided himself on now seemed like a

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:44.780 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
child's naive dream before the all-
knowing, almighty God.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:51.300 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He could not even lessen his own wife's
tears. What could he really do?

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.290 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Suddenly, Liao understood:

00:09:54.790 --> 00:10:00.962 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Only by showing people how to look to
God and receive Him could they find

00:10:00.962 --> 00:10:03.330 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
genuine peace and happiness.
